                     /note="Ribosomal protein L11 is one of the proteins from
                     the 50S large ribosomal subunit. In E. coli, L11 is known
                     to bind directly to the 23S rRNA. L11 is a protein of 140
                     to 165 amino-acid residues. The C-terminal half of L11 has
                     been shown to be in an extended and loosely folded
                     conformation and is likely to be buried within the
                     ribosomal structure."
