                     thought to be associated with the D1 (PsbA) - D2 (PsbD)
                     heterodimer. PsbT may be involved in the formation and/or
                     stabilisation of dimeric PSII complexes and should be
                     required for the efficient recovery of photo-damaged
                     PSII."
